================================================================================

None of the following is ours to relicense; each is redistributed or referenced
under its own terms, and the original sources are authoritative:

  - Todor et al. 2026 pooled screen            Zenodo 15499631
  - O'Reilly et al. 2020 in-cell crosslinks    PRIDE PXD017711 / PXD017695, CC0
  - Humphreys et al. 2021 yeast predictions    ModelArchive ma-bak-cepc
  - Burke et al. 2023 human predictions        as published
  - Lluch-Senar et al. 2015 essentiality/SEC   as published
  - RCSB PDB, SIFTS                            as published
  - UniProt sequences and MSAs                 CC BY 4.0
  - ChEMBL approved-drug structures            CC BY-SA 3.0

`cleanroom/msa/*.a3m` are built from public sequence databases and inherit those
databases' terms.
